00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:25.792
-Okay.
-Okay, so, but first, the fire.

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:28.227
Do you ever use
a fire extinguisher?

00:00:28.227 --> 00:00:29.729
Do you have a fire extinguisher?
-Weekly.

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:31.197
-I hope so.
-Yeah.

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:33.966
-A lot of fire extinguishers --
You put out a lot of fires.

00:00:33.966 --> 00:00:35.668
Trust me, I know.

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:38.271
So, a lot of fire extinguishers
are filled with

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:40.506
CO2, carbon dioxide, right?

00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:42.842
And, so, carbon dioxide puts out
fire very, very well.

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:44.343
So, we have a tank here.

00:00:44.343 --> 00:00:45.512
There's a cylinder down there

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:47.447
