into this fish tank.

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:48.548
I'm going to give you
this lantern.

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:50.049
-Aha.
-So, go ahead.

00:00:50.049 --> 00:00:52.351
I'm going to move this lid off,
and you can just lower it down

00:00:52.351 --> 00:00:53.620
into the fish tank.

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:55.888
And we'll see
what happens to the fire.

00:00:55.888 --> 00:00:58.257
-CO2 is being pumped right now?
-There you go.

00:00:58.257 --> 00:00:59.425
And it just goes out.

00:00:59.425 --> 00:01:00.526
You can take it out
and then put it down.

00:01:00.526 --> 00:01:01.627
-That's fantastic.

00:01:01.627 --> 00:01:03.463
-So, most fire goes out

00:01:03.463 --> 00:01:05.464
