carbon dioxide.

00:01:05.464 --> 00:01:07.166
Magnesium doesn't do that.

00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:09.435
So, we have some magnesium
in this block.

00:01:09.435 --> 00:01:10.870
This is dry ice.
-Okay.

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:12.906
-So, dry ice is just
frozen carbon dioxide.

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:15.108
Same stuff, different phase --
that's all.

00:01:15.108 --> 00:01:16.609
So, I'm going to
light it on fire.

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:17.877
And then you have your gloves,

00:01:17.877 --> 00:01:19.912
and you want to put
that block on top of this block.

00:01:19.912 --> 00:01:21.647
We're going to smother it
and we're going to see how it

00:01:21.647 --> 00:01:23.917
reacts in a carbon-dioxide
environment, okay?

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:25.051
-And this is just magnesium.

00:01:25.051 --> 00:01:26.619
-This is magnesium,
shaved magnesium.

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:27.687
-Shaved magnesium.
-Okay, ready?

00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:28.921
-Wait, hold on. No.
-Okay.

00:01:28.921 --> 00:01:31.257
-Wait. Do I walk away?
-No, no, no.

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:33.126
-I'm always nervous,
because, yeah, it was --

00:01:33.126 --> 00:01:34.194
-So, I'm going to light it.

00:01:34.194 --> 00:01:35.294
It's going to take a
couple seconds,

00:01:35.294 --> 00:01:36.329
and then you just want to
grab that block

00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:37.396
and just fit it on top.

00:01:37.396 --> 00:01:38.531
-Okay.
-Okay?

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:39.565
-Yeah.
-So, here we go.

00:01:39.565 --> 00:01:43.169
I'm going to light it.

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:47.172
Okay.
[ Drumroll ]

00:01:47.172 --> 00:01:50.677
-Oh, yeah.
You've done this before.

00:01:50.677 --> 00:01:51.910
-Ready to go?
-Yeah.

00:01:51.910 --> 00:01:53.579
-Alright, here we go.
Go ahead and put it on.

00:01:53.579 --> 00:01:55.181
Now stand back.

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:56.215
-Whoa!

00:01:56.215 --> 00:01:58.318
-And we're going to lower
the lights.

00:01:58.318 --> 00:02:00.586
-Wow!

00:02:00.586 --> 00:02:02.956
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:06.859
-So, that magnesium is
just pulling that oxygen

00:02:06.859 --> 00:02:09.962
