00:04:04.109 --> 00:04:06.278
-Alright, for a second...
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:06.278 --> 00:04:09.248
And now -- Still stay far away,
because -- Don't --

00:04:09.248 --> 00:04:10.416
Don't walk that way.

00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:11.818
Don't walk that way
or else -- Yeah.

00:04:11.818 --> 00:04:13.819
-It's okay. It's okay.
-Yeah, yeah. Wow!

00:04:13.819 --> 00:04:14.987
-And you didn't move.
-I didn't move.

00:04:14.987 --> 00:04:16.121
-That's the key.
-I was cool about it.

00:04:16.121 --> 00:04:18.124
-Yeah. Very cool.
-I didn't freak out.

00:04:18.124 --> 00:04:21.227
♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:21.227 --> 00:04:23.229
I was cool.
I didn't freak out.

00:04:23.229 --> 00:04:24.630
-Okay.
-What do we have here?

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:26.632
-Venturi effect.
-Venturi.

00:04:26.632 --> 00:04:28.133
-Venturi effect. Okay.

00:04:28.133 --> 00:04:32.104
So, when airflow is in
a small tube like this,

00:04:32.104 --> 00:04:33.839
it creates low pressure.

00:04:33.839 --> 00:04:35.241
And if we connect another tube

00:04:35.241 --> 00:04:37.476
to that area of low pressure,

00:04:37.476 --> 00:04:39.912
anything that's in the tube
is going to get pulled

00:04:39.912 --> 00:04:41.881
into that airflow and sucked up.

00:04:41.881 --> 00:04:45.585
So, what we have here is
a little mini Venturi tube.

00:04:45.585 --> 00:04:48.554
So, all you want to do is give
it a soft and gentle breath

00:04:48.554 --> 00:04:51.189
into that end of the tube,
and we'll see what happens.

00:04:51.189 --> 00:04:54.960
-This is legal in --
-It's gonna hold -- I think so.

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:58.163
You're almost there.
So, just give it a little blow.

00:04:58.163 --> 00:05:00.766
There. Kind of like
a snow globe.

00:05:00.766 --> 00:05:02.301
-Oh, yeah.
-Very pretty.

00:05:02.301 --> 00:05:06.972
Yeah. So, should we
kick this up a little bit?

00:05:06.972 --> 00:05:09.642
